# The Quay | EXT | Terreiro Do Paco, River Wall | DAY | joao, teles, amaro | See the water leave | The Tagus draws out. Ships lie over in mud. People walk onto the riverbed. {joao} starts to shout and is told he blasphemes | The sea is coming back | 6 | water, crowd=600, vfx=drained riverbed
# The Quay | EXT | Terreiro Do Paco, Steps | DAY | ines, joao, amaro | Walk uphill | {ines} takes off her veil, lifts a stranger's child and climbs. Women follow. Then men. {amaro} carries two more | Hundreds leave the quay | 6 | crowd=400
# The Wave | EXT | Rua Nova, Rising Street | DAY | joao, ines, amaro | Outrun it | The wave takes the quay behind them and comes up the street to their knees. {teles} is not seen again | | 6 | water, crowd=200, stunts=flood run, vfx=tsunami
# The Hill | EXT | Castle Hill | DUSK | joao, ines, amaro | Make a list | The city burning below. {amaro} asks what is to be done. {joao} answers, and begins writing names | | 4 | crowd=150, vfx=city on fire, props=ledger
review: authored | 2026-11-12 | written whole; drawn from the earthquake of 1755, with invented people
